{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore Your Island is a slow, cozy restoration sim about healing a damaged island and building a peaceful home. Revive nature, and watch wildlife return as the ecosystem comes back to life. Explore at your own pace with your loyal dog by your side.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698420/extras/a5ba6e70aefba548c47bf4d1b1b5dd5b.poster.avif?t=1772787854\" width=800 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698420/extras/a5ba6e70aefba548c47bf4d1b1b5dd5b.webm?t=1772787854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698420/extras/a5ba6e70aefba548c47bf4d1b1b5dd5b.mp4?t=1772787854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore &amp; plan</strong> explore the island, spot areas that need care, and choose what to restore next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean &amp; Repair</strong>\u00a0 remove trash, mend structures, Heal trees actions that let nature begin to recover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebuild habitats</strong> use tools to rescue wildlife, and bring nature back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sustain through your journey\u00a0</strong>revived trees and gathered fruit provide resources and energy to reach new parts of the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bond with your dog\u00a0</strong>pet, play quick mini-games, and get the occasional helpful cue or small reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax\u00a0</strong>unwind by the fireplace with music, water ambience, sunsets and other cozy features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow &amp; discover\u00a0</strong>upgrade tools, unlock new areas, and uncover hidden secrets across a brighter island<strong>. </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698420/extras/59458cb0589057b226c2979f324140c8.poster.avif?t=1772787854\" width=800 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698420/extras/59458cb0589057b226c2979f324140c8.webm?t=1772787854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698420/extras/59458cb0589057b226c2979f324140c8.mp4?t=1772787854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clear, satisfying progress:</strong> every cleaning, repair, and re-greening shows immediate results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A companion with heart:\u00a0</strong>your dog reacts to pets, plays, adds warmth to every session.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Low-pressure cozy play:\u00a0</strong>no combat, no harsh timers, play in short bursts or long, relaxing sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets to uncover:</strong> hidden groves, buried treasures, and small environmental mysteries reward curiosity.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698420/extras/c865ff062d55268ddb4bb2f4e11c5bb8.poster.avif?t=1772787854\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698420/extras/c865ff062d55268ddb4bb2f4e11c5bb8.webm?t=1772787854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698420/extras/c865ff062d55268ddb4bb2f4e11c5bb8.mp4?t=1772787854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2698420?t=1772787854","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698420/dfdc36167dc35c08c93bde8dcf17e20930c5aa2d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772787854","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698420/cc76ccd48709e4ffdfad268f2e9e47676e237684/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772787854","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698420/cc76ccd48709e4ffdfad268f2e9e47676e237684/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772787854","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3981120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore Your Island is a slow, cozy restoration sim about healing a damaged island and building a peaceful home. Revive nature, and watch wildlife return as the ecosystem comes back to life. Explore at your own pace with your loyal dog by your side.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698420/extras/